8/21/2026 Todd Carnes <toddcarnes@gmail.com>:

* Release Automation: Created GitHub Actions release deployment workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml) to automatically package and attach self-contained game bundles (Windows .zip, macOS .tar.gz, Linux .tar.gz) on release tag publication.
* Continuous Integration: Separated build CI into per-OS workflows (.github/workflows/build-windows.yml, build-macos.yml, build-linux.yml) with live status badges on README.md.
* Application Icon: Appended src/sdlhana.rc to Windows executable target for native Windows Explorer icon embedding and implemented cross-platform SetAppWindowIcon() using SDL_SetWindowIcon() and sdlhana.xpm.
* Game Engine Fixes: Reset m_iScore to 0 in InitGame() to prevent score leaking across game sessions, and isolated Korean-specific "Leave Three" scoring rules to GAMEMODE_KOREAN.
* Developer Tools: Created tools/CMakeLists.txt with optional SDLHANA_BUILD_TOOLS CMake build flag for title2cl, removing legacy Autotools Makefiles and #ifdef WITH_CONFIG_H blocks.
* Documentation: Updated README.md with Game Modes, Supported Languages, and GNU Savannah project attribution.

8/20/2026 Todd Carnes <toddcarnes@gmail.com>:

* Build System: Replaced legacy autotools/VC++6 .dsp scripts with modern CMake 3.25+ (CMakeLists.txt) supporting Windows 11 (Visual Studio 2026 MSVC), macOS (Clang), and Linux (GCC).
* Graphics Engine: Migrated rendering pipeline from legacy software SDL_Surface CPU blitting to native hardware-accelerated SDL3 (SDL_Window*, SDL_Renderer*, SDL_Texture*). Added letterboxed 640x480 logical presentation canvas and coordinate mapping for windowed and fullscreen modes (SDL_RenderCoordinatesFromWindow).
* Audio Engine: Refactored audio handling from low-level PCM audio stream conversion to native SDL3_mixer (MIX_Init, MIX_CreateMixerDevice, MIX_LoadAudio, MIX_PlayAudio).
* Font Engine: Upgraded CFont into a hybrid font renderer supporting vector TrueType/OpenType fonts via SDL3_ttf with INI configuration (UseTTF=1, TTFFontPath=...) while preserving 100% fallback support for original 2005 compressed .fnt bitmap fonts (eng.fnt, fra.fnt, chs.fnt, jpn.fnt).
* State & File System: Encapsulated loose global pointers into a unified Application context singleton. Modernized save/config handling to use SDL_GetPrefPath() and std::filesystem::path for cross-platform preference storage.
* C++23 Modernization: Refactored raw memory management to std::unique_ptr and stack RAII, modernized C-string/printf formatting with std::println and <print>, and updated random number generation with <random> (std::mt19937).
* Continuous Integration: Created GitHub Actions matrix workflow (.github/workflows/build.yml) automating build validation on Windows, macOS, and Linux runners.

